MID_BD16_06_m01: <TH>
MID_BD16_06_m01_001: Looks like we're surrounded, Talimun. Tell me\nyou've got a plan.
MID_BD16_06_m01_002: Working on it. We need to change our approach—\npush them back, if we can.
MID_BD16_06_m01_003: Shoulda said so earlier. Been looking for a reason to\ncut loose.
MID_BD16_06_m01_004: Remember, we're still in the city. Make too big a\nshow, and we'll have soldiers raining down on us too.
MID_BD16_06_m01_005: And if that happens, everything could go sideways.\nWe'll have to wait this out.
MID_BD16_06_m01_006: You're a truly foolish man, aren't you? Well, the least\nI can do is ask your name before I kill you.
MID_BD16_06_m01_007: Never heard of Talimun of the Vandahl Trading\nCompany? Well, that's quite a surprise.
MID_BD16_06_m01_008: Talimun? Of the Vandahl Trading Company?
MID_BD16_06_m02: <TH>
MID_BD16_06_m02_001: Perhaps I should play instead. I promise, you've\nnever felt anything like it.
MID_BD16_06_m06: <TH>
MID_BD16_06_m02_002: Feel as though you're rising into heaven...as you\nplummet into the underworld.
MID_BD16_06_m03: <TH>
MID_BD16_06_m03_001: *gasp*
MID_BD16_06_m03_002: How? How can you move while listening to this?
MID_BD16_06_m03_003: Don't tell me... You're...
MID_BD16_06_m03_004: I see it. The resemblance... To that sailor!
MID_BD16_06_m03_005: Huh? Strange. I think I'd remember a face like yours.\nIf we've met, I guess I left quite the impression.
MID_BD16_06_m03_006: That is who you are, isn't it? If that's the case, I'll\nstrangle the life out of you with my own hands!
MID_BD16_06_m03_007: Eh? I must be missing something here.
MID_BD16_06_m03_008: Must've said something to end up on your bad side.
MID_BD16_06_m04: <TH>
MID_BD16_06_m04_001: Interesting. It is just as you said.
MID_BD16_06_m04_002: Hey, Talimun, don't tell me this is the other plan you\nwere talking about?
MID_BD16_06_m04_003: Yup! But I'm as surprised he came as you.
MID_BD16_06_m04_004: This guy... I've seen his type before. He's got the\naura of a natural-born killer.
MID_BD16_06_m04_005: Just looking at him makes me wanna reach for\nmy weapon.
MID_BD16_06_m04_006: You... I remember you! What are you doing here?
MID_BD16_06_m04_007: Ah, it is you. I had thought to seek a duel with you.
MID_BD16_06_m04_008: There is much more to you than there was to\nthat lout.
MID_BD16_06_m04_009: You're as troublesome as the rest. But more\nbeautiful than the rest as well...
MID_BD16_06_m05: <TH>
MID_BD16_06_m05_001: We're out of time, it seems. Linger any longer, and\nwe'll have soldiers to deal with too.
MID_BD16_06_m05_002: Apologies, but I can't finish killing you right now.\nLucky you. Enjoy your breath while you still have it.
MID_BD16_06_m05_Footer: <TEDF>
